WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.208
Step 1: Use the floating Cart button on Catalogue, Stock count, Order history, Transfers or stock-management pages.

2
00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:17.083
Step 2: Adjust quantities, remove items or enter notes under each supplier. Supplier notes stay with this user and location across Ordering pages. Stock count’s Add to cart uses the same cart.

3
00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:23.083
Step 3: Check the weekly budget and supplier delivery guidance before ordering.

4
00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:29.583
Step 4: Cancel the final review if you need to change anything; your cart and notes remain available.
